Show the whole tree (or a subtree) of an ext2/3/4, erofs or f2fs image, recursively, without extracting it

Usage: android-doctor tree [OPTIONS] <IMAGE> [PATH]

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>  
  [PATH]   Path inside the image to start from (default: the root) [default: /]

Options:
      --depth <N>  Show at most N levels below the start path
      --no-color   Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
      --json       Print JSON instead of text (doctor/1 envelope, no findings)
  -h, --help       Print help
